# Distributed state files / backups (contains sensitive architecture data)
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# Crash logs
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Override local configuration files
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Variable files containing actual secret keys/passwords
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Ignore local CLI config files
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Private spike/evidence artifacts
SPIKE_NOTES.md
*.zip

# NOTE: fixtures/sample-finding-event.json was previously listed here while also
# being tracked, so the ignore had no effect and misdescribed the repo. It is the
# real EventBridge envelope banked by P1, already redacted, and the proposer
# handler tests load it. It is tracked on purpose.

# Internal working docs.
# COST.md and PRODUCTION_GAP.md are deliberately public: they are where deferred
# scope and cost honesty live, and a reviewer has to be able to open them.
#
# docs/ai-workflow.md is the full internal record, including the working rules
# and delivery strategy. AI_WORKFLOW.md is its redacted public counterpart and
# IS tracked. Keep new sessions in both: full detail here, engineering-only there.
PLAN.md
docs/ai-workflow.md

